{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">政制及內地事務局局長謝小華會見傳媒，總結香港第一份五年規劃的公眾諮詢。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">謝小華指，收到逾1.6萬份建議，目標九月發表。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-14T13:40:05.886919+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":59,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}